OL,3,GNEWSA'Every cost has gone up': Science
OL,4,Amuseum on the brink
OL,5,
OL,6,FA science museum in Cheshire is at risk
OL,7,Fof closing within two months unless it
OL,8,Fcan raise enough money to keep its
OL,9,Fdoors open, its chief executive has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FNikki Burton said the Catalyst Science
OL,13,FDiscovery Centre and Museum in Widnes
OL,14,Fhad been hit by a "perfect storm" of
OL,15,Flow visitor numbers and rising costs
OL,16,Fand was struggling financially.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
